  "description": "Fastest of the fat. 24 x 6.2.\n\nBuilt on our magical SB2 platform… this one is spaced much wider to fit the meatiest of meats.\n\nBelieve or not, stripped down, coaster only, our lightweight sb2 frame and fork…this thing rides v nice.\n\nNo gears or handbrakes to get jammed up with ice or sand…the coaster brake is in its element on this bike.\n\nDoomonē bars. A brooks. Thomson post. Custom carbon front hub. Surly’s new molenda rim and tire laced to our souped up coaster hub based on a KT fat jammer.\n\nDid I mention I really like how this bike rides? There won't be another one. It's not exactly sensible, but sensibility ain't exactly our thing.",
